 drivers/net/phy/Kconfig    |  10 +
 drivers/net/phy/Makefile   |   1 +
 drivers/net/phy/dap8211r.c | 544 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 555 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/net/phy/dap8211r.c

